  <h1>Eclipse Cabinetry</h1>
  <p class="dive-tagline">Full-access frameless cabinetry branded "eclipse by Shiloh." Built at the same Dudley, Missouri factory, on the same hardware program, with an exclusive specialty-materials library (acrylic, HPL, TFL, PV) that no other Pinnacle-rep'd line offers.</p>
</header>

<div class="rep-note">
  <strong>For the rep — how to walk this page (≈18 min):</strong> Designers who don't know Eclipse usually think it's a different company. Open by anchoring it as "Shiloh's frameless sister brand, same factory, same lead time, same hardware" — then spend the time in Construction and Door Styles. Close with "When to specify Eclipse vs. Pronorm" because that's the question a designer with a modern client will actually ask.
</div>

